# GO-2026-5932: golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained and unsafe by
# design (Trivy: UNKNOWN; the CI gate fails on UNKNOWN). Trivy flags the whole
# module (v0.58.0) in the server binary.
# Not exploitable here: the only x/crypto package this service imports is
# x/crypto/pbkdf2 (password hashing); nothing imports x/crypto/openpgp.
# Blocked upstream: the only fix is an untagged pseudo-version
# (0.58.1-0.20261009181718-2f1f834330b2); iam-org-membership found no tagged
# x/crypto release carrying the fix on 2026-11-03. Remove this entry and bump
# x/crypto once a tagged release carries the fix.
# Mirrors iam-org-membership/.trivyignore.
GO-2026-5932 exp:2026-12-03
